# I work as a doctor in Russian: рабо́таю врачо́м
subtitle: "Say what you work as, what you go in for and what you write with in Russian: the with-ending without с, рабо́таю врачо́м, занима́юсь спо́ртом, пишу́ ру́чкой."
teaches: ["grammar/with-ending"]
thumb: "band \"The with-ending, minus the with\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Phoning mum in Russian: звоню́ ма́ме","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/57-russian-dative.cast"}

## I work as a doctor in Russian: рабо́таю врачо́м
level: basic

    icon masha size 140 set twemoji x 120 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 120 y 360 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon tom size 140 set twemoji x 880 y 470 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 880 y 360 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon photo size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 500 or ["older person","man"] icon_look picture of "old man" hidden true
    text photo_l "па́па" #8f887c say па́па x 500 y 390 font_size 36 hidden true
    icon j_teach size 120 set twemoji x 330 y 230 or ["teacher","school"] icon_look picture of "man teacher" hidden true
    icon j_doc size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 230 or ["health worker","stethoscope"] icon_look picture of "man health worker" hidden true
    icon j_cook size 120 set twemoji x 670 y 230 or ["cook","cooking"] icon_look picture of "man cook" hidden true
