A: Masha is showing Tom an old photo of her dad. Listen first, with no words on the screen.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name photo photo_l

A: Э́то твой па́па? Кем он был?
    draw j_teach j_doc j_cook caption false

B: Да. Мой па́па был учи́телем.
    caption false

    ask "What was her dad's job? Tap the picture." listen "Мой па́па был учи́телем." voice b gloss "My dad was a teacher." on ["j_teach","j_doc","j_cook"] correct 1
        right: A teacher: учи́телем.
        wrong: Listen for учи́тель, from last time, inside it.

    erase j_teach j_cook j_doc

    erase photo photo_l

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw ex1 ex2

A: So how do you say what someone is, or was, for a living? Listen to учи́телем: last time's teacher, with ем on the end.
    highlight ex2_w_4 color #8a5fa8 part ем$

    draw ref36

A: That's the with-ending of lesson thirty-six, чай с ча́ем; but here there's no с.
    highlight ref36 color #8a5fa8 part ем$

    erase ref36

    draw kem

A: And кем is кто with the with-ending: кем он был? What was he?
    highlight ex1_w_1 color #8f887c effect underline

    erase ex1 ex2 kem

B: А я врач. Я рабо́таю врачо́м.
    draw masha masha_name s1

    draw ref38

A: Врач you know from lesson thirty-eight. After рабо́таю it takes ом: врачо́м, for a woman too.
    highlight s1_w_3 color #2f6b8f part ом$

    erase s1 ref38

    hide masha masha_name

    draw r_doc t_doc r_cook t_cook

B: Том — по́вар, a cook. Он рабо́тает по́варом в рестора́не.
    highlight t_cook color #2f6b8f part ом$

    draw r_teach t_teach

A: Учи́тель ends in ь, so it takes ем, like чай, с ча́ем; when the ending is stressed, it's ём.
    highlight t_teach color #8a5fa8 part ем$

    erase r_doc t_doc r_cook t_cook r_teach t_teach

A: Был takes it, as Masha said; so does быть, to be, after хочу́.
    draw kid

A: Russians ask every child: кем ты хо́чешь быть?
    draw kid_t

    erase kid kid_t

A: A new verb: занима́ться, to go in for: я занима́юсь, ты занима́ешься.
    draw zan

A: The сь or ся on the end comes in lesson sixty-one.
    highlight zan color #8f887c part ся$ effect underline

B: Я занима́юсь спо́ртом. И му́зыкой.
    draw ball sport notes music

    draw chem

A: Спорт adds ом, му́зыка swaps а for ой, as after с. And что becomes чем: чем ты занима́ешься?
    highlight sport music color #8f887c effect underline

    erase zan ball sport notes music chem

    draw pen pen_t

A: Last, the tool you use. Ру́чка is a pen, and пишу́ is I write, from писа́ть: я пишу́ ру́чкой.
    highlight pen_t color #2f6b8f part ой$

A: No с: с ру́чкой is a pen you carry along, like с бра́том.
    draw pen_x

    erase pen pen_t pen_x

    group board members ["b1","b1_l","b2","b2_l","b3","b3_l","b4","b4_l"]

A: So the with-ending works without с too: the job you do or did, what you go in for, the tool in your hand.
    highlight b1 b2 b3 b4 color #8f887c effect underline

    hide board

A: Now Tom and Masha talk about work and free time. Listen; then practise it.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, а кем рабо́тает Ива́н?","gloss":"Masha, and what does Ivan do?"},{"by":"b","text":"Он рабо́тает учи́телем в О́сло. И пи́шет кни́ги.","gloss":"He works as a teacher in Oslo. And he writes books."},{"by":"a","text":"А ты? Чем ты занима́ешься ве́чером?","gloss":"And you? What do you do in the evenings?"},{"by":"b","text":"Я занима́юсь спо́ртом и му́зыкой.","gloss":"I do sport and music."},{"by":"a","text":"Спо́ртом? Я то́же! Я игра́ю в те́ннис.","gloss":"Sport? Me too! I play tennis."},{"by":"b","text":"Дава́й в суббо́ту игра́ть в те́ннис!","gloss":"Let's play tennis on Saturday!"}] practice true size 1.6

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    icon q_cook size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["cook"] icon_look picture of "man cook"

    quiz "Tom is a cook. He says: Я рабо́таю ___. Which word fills the gap?" above q_cook reveal.text "Я рабо́таю по́варом." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: По́варом: the job you work as takes ом.
        wrong: After рабо́таю, the job takes the with-ending, as in рабо́таю врачо́м.
        * по́вара
        + по́варом
        * по́вар

    erase q_cook

    icon q_notes size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["musical note"] icon_look picture of "musical notes"

    quiz "Masha does music. Я занима́юсь ___. Which is right?" above q_notes reveal.text "Я занима́юсь му́зыкой." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Му́зыкой: after занима́юсь, the а becomes ой.
        wrong: Занима́юсь takes the with-ending: му́зыка → му́зыкой, the а becomes ой, as after с.
        + му́зыкой
        * му́зыку
        * му́зыка

    erase q_notes

    icon q_pen size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["fountain pen","writing hand"] icon_look picture of pen

    quiz "Say: I write with a pen. Which is right?" above q_pen reveal.text "Я пишу́ ру́чкой." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: A tool takes the with-ending, and no с.
        wrong: С ру́чкой is a pen you carry along. What you write with needs no с.
        * Я пишу́ с ру́чкой.
        * Я пишу́ ру́чку.
        + Я пишу́ ру́чкой.

    erase q_pen

    icon q_masha size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman

    ask "Ask Masha: what do you do for a living?" say_it "Кем ты рабо́таешь?" voice a show cue test t1
        gloss: What do you do for a living?

B: Врачо́м! Я рабо́таю врачо́м.
    text q_say "Кем ты рабо́таешь? — Врачо́м!" say "Кем ты рабо́таешь? Врачо́м!" colors {"ом$":"#2f6b8f"} x 500 y 270 font_size 56

    erase q_masha q_say

    icon q_dad size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["teacher","man"] icon_look picture of "man teacher"

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: My dad was a teacher." above q_dad answer ["мой папа был учителем","папа был учителем"] reveal.text "Мой па́па был учи́телем." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Мой па́па был учи́телем: after был, учи́тель takes ем.
        wrong: Start with мой па́па был, then учи́тель with the with-ending.

    erase q_dad

    icon score_pic size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["woman"] icon_look picture of "woman health worker"

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_pic

    show board

A: So listen for ом, ой or ем with no с in front: a job, a hobby, or a tool.
    highlight b1 b2 b3 b4 color #8f887c effect underline

    erase board

B: А вы? Кем вы рабо́таете? Say it out loud. Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text end_say "А вы? Кем вы рабо́таете?" say "А вы? Кем вы рабо́таете?" x 500 y 270 font_size 60

    erase end_masha end_say

A: Next time: звоню́ ма́ме, the to-ending in full.
    box next57 "Next: lesson 57 · звоню́ ма́ме" say "звоню́ ма́ме" x 500 y 430 width 640 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

